# user data — never commit
gallery/
uploads/
logs/
data/
*.log
*.pid
# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
# macOS
.DS_Store
.claude/
build/

# Maintainer notes stay on the maintainer's Mac and are not published, as in Murmur: agent instructions, the changelog
# (each GitHub release carries its notes), plans, roadmaps, design notes, test plans and release/security write-ups.
# Root-level names are anchored so workspaces and test fixtures that contain an AGENTS.md or CLAUDE.md are unaffected.
/CLAUDE.md
/AGENTS.md
/CHANGELOG.md
docs/*.md
!docs/GUIDE.md
docs/*.json
docs/superpowers/
docs/prompts/
